1 - About
    -----

    “Proofcase” is a collection of
    self-contained original Rocq
    contributions, typically as
    a formal companion to a paper,
    note, or conceptual construction.


2 - Theories and Build
    ------------------

    The package index is in theories/README.

    Run _tools/1_compile.command from the project. It builds the root
    _CoqProject in scratch/shadow and checks that theories/ contains no
    compiler artifacts.


